{"answer":"Based on the current offers documented in our knowledge base, the strongest confirmed sign-up bonus is the EcoCard: earn 2,000 sustainability points—worth $20 when redeemed as a statement credit or Rho-Bank checking-account credit—after spending $5,000 in eligible purchases during your first month. Its annual fee is $50, so the bonus alone does not offset the first-year fee.

For comparison, the Silver Rewards Card has a $0 annual fee, but I found no confirmed sign-up bonus. The Gold Rewards Card also has a $0 annual fee and earns 2.5% cash back on purchases, but I found no documented promotional sign-up bonus; it requires an active Rho-Bank+ subscription.

Recommendation: Choose the EcoCard if maximizing the confirmed introductory bonus is your top priority and you can meet the $5,000 first-month spending requirement. Choose the Silver Rewards Card if you prefer to avoid an annual fee and want a straightforward no-fee option. I could not verify a broader, current card-wide promotion comparison from the available records."}
